      "comment": "IVORY PANKE (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Ultimo (24.17) in a Grade 5. Took the lead and boxed on but run over. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Top prospect. MR. JONES (6) missed the frame latest but had been racing well prior to that including a Grade 5 win two back (23.43) at Gawler. Key player on best and worth another try. STARLORD BALE (3) well back settling but did wind up strongly to finish 5th and beaten only 5 lengths (24.20) at this track. Has won two of three starts from this draw. Can measure up this time. COLLINDA RAMSAY (7) is a chance after winning last time.",
